silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_08_joc_and_regression_sections_03_failure_mode_atlas_concrete_anchor_26_YonedaProfileMittens#yonedaprofilemittens silm:hasLongDescription "The YonedaProfileMittens is the representable presheaf O_11(-, Mittens) recovering Mittens up to natural iso. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'YonedaProfileMittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
